# The runtime skeleton's storage is generated, but `storage/responses` is not:
# it holds the `@responseFile` fixtures the Workbench controllers document, and
# tests/TestCase.php copies them into the skeleton before each test. Ignoring
# the whole directory left the suite passing only on machines that happened to
# have the file on disk. Excluding the *contents* is what allows the negation —
# git will not re-include a path whose parent directory is itself excluded.
/storage/*
!/storage/responses/
.env
